<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1TH- Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="rem">1st draft 2014, Advisor check with Yobe and Joseph, March 2015</para>
  <para style="rem">VE by Anne Jan/Feb 2017</para>
  <para style="rem">March 2017 After VE some more editing with Wabele, Jack, Yobe and Dickson</para>
  <para style="rem">CC - remote consultant check by correspondence by Paulus Kieviet in 2019</para>
  <para style="rem">Final team read through with Yobe, Felix and Jack in May 2023, Anne via Zoom from NL</para>
  <para style="h">Agele Desalonaika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Desalonaika Sesefea Sowi Agele Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Desalonaika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Des</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Desalonaika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Desalonaika Sesefea</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sowi Agele Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Desalonaika daunomo, Masedonia Hele ami dauno bule ufulu. Folo e misini dabalu mololabia siba ligia, edai, Saelesedai, Filibai sidi afasia, aalu Desalonaika goalu. Ami ligia, aalu sese maugaba degeba ifolu. (Hilibaisi Daalu 17.1-9 ami bamale.) Auluso, Yudane guni inolo ami alebailumohe, idele inolo wedinale ilimo Folone sulu kuliba abia, keliso adefe baafia, ilihe Folodai Saelesedai aalufea babiyo habosia, woba moloyo hilisesi, aalu Desalonaika dauno afasia fisaba daalu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dufia, Folodai, Saelesedai, aalu Kolidi sidi ami miliyo daafia ligia, Desalonaika sesemo halaguba labelaba keleba hilisesia, aine ua dabalu mololo Dimodi ehe fadaba bamesisia, ami hilibailu. Dimodi e ami dafasia, obegeba inigia, Folodai aalufea kegele Desalonaika keliso idele inolofea mololumo awaba melu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Folohe Dimodi awalu amo dofasia, eda, Saeleseda, Dimodida, ilihe Desalonaika keliso idele inolo ine asigi ule ufulu kiwigaaba homesine, ilifea sowi ewe seleba melu. Sowi ewefeamo, Folohe Desalonaika keliso idele inolone asigi ule ufulu amofea henesia, mana nafulu ili moloba yaalu amoneda henelu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ninihe sowi ewe alegasiamo, eweguba besabe. Desalonaika sigidubulu idele inolo ili amomo, Yesu Keliso obegeba miyo amone elawanesia, keleba hiliselu. Ili eweguba asigiyo hamelu. Yesu obegeba saabimo, hilia amo, daneba yaalu dobu ili amofea halaguba moloyobafebiba asigiyo hamelu. Aufia, Keliso E koleba, fogo halaiyago miyobafebiba hiliselu. Ausi, Folohe sowi ewe seleba mesiamo, e doba abulu amone sulu obegelu. Aufia, ehe ilifea selesia, ilihe balu kakainasiale, mana nafulu moloba yaasia, Saminilo milesi madenefia yasiba melaleba selefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dawalolu inolo wedinale ili hilisesia, sowi ewe Folohe maugaba selelale seleluba hilisefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">HD 17.1-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Foloda</char>, Saeleseda, <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodida</char>, ninihe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Sowi ewe, Desalonaika daunone sese alebaibu gili amofea seleba mebaisu. Gilimo, Nao Godefeada, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofeada</char>, kulifia labe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Godehe gili kanuluba ofelesia, gili <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> melesi moloba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Desalonaika sese ine asigi ule ufulu amone baafia henelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Hilia sunia, ninihe gili sunia hilisesia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selabasu</char> ligia, Efea henelu sulu sodo. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:13">1Kld 13.13</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:4-6">Kol 1.4-6</ref></char></note>Auba selabasu adomo, gilihe gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogo alefasia, mana nafulu moloba adomone, nini Godefea henelu sulu sodo. Aufia, gine hameselo ogo alefasia, gili noolofea hogololu dabalu moloba ado amoneda, nini henelu sulu sodo. Aufia, gilihe nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisofea gine <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasife</char> ogo alefasia, gilimo libo kiwigaafia ado amoneda, ninihe Nao Godefea henelu sulu sodo.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, Godehe gili hamesebu koleba. Aufia, nini hilisesia, Godehe gilimo Ene koleba melesi molobebeleluba hilisebu. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:4-5">1Kld 2.4-5</ref></char></note>Maumo, ninihe awalu sulu nafulu ewe gili labea dibia mulumo, sulu balu dibia muluale. Aubale. Amo e kiwida alefasia inigiamo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenehe</char> gine asigimo nine sulu amo seale kolebaba hilisemesi mololu. Nini gili aleba sigiamo, ninihe gili sagoba ofa dabalu mololumo, gili asigibu. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5-9">HD 17.5-9</ref></char></note>Gili Godene sulu disi, higinilu wedinale gilifea holobagagalu. Auluso, gilihe nine manada, Saminilone manada, kuliba abia, Asubane Noekenehe gili degeba ifosi, higinilu dobia ami, gili heneso. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Aulugulu, gili auba ligia, nine mimisililu holobagalu. Aufia, gilihe hele <char style="w" lemma="Masedonia">Masedoniadai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Akaea">Akaeadai</char>, sigidubulu idele inolo suniafea kuliba milesine dedeba moloba walelu. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Gilifeafia Saminilone sulu amomo, ilibo galaloguba galalu. Gala amo, gine hele Masedoniadai, Akaeadai, amisu galaluale. Aubale. Hele sunia idele inolohe, gili Godefea asigi ule ufuluba sulu solu amo doba sigilu. Aulugulu, ninihe inolo noolofea gili amone saaba, saabia no sulu saeyone dabalu male. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Maumo, ili suniahe selesia, gilihe nini heneba luba dulubiyoba selabasu adefe. Aufia, ili selesia, gilimo <char style="w" lemma="Masega gode">masega godemo</char> afasia, nolofia, Godefealo dedalelubiyoba selefe. Aufia, ili sunia hilisesia, gili aga seale Gode bebea labemofea gulugulufeba asigibu. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Aufia, ili hilisesia, gilimo, Godene Faibe <char style="w">hebene</char> afasia, obegeba miyobafe amone yasifia alebaifeba asigibu. Godene Faibe amo, Yesu E. E olaluso, Godehe E degeba ifolu. Dufia, Godehe idele inolo osolasia fadaafeiyamo, Yesuhe nini gadilofealo amofeafia gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyobafe.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Folo e Desalonaika ami dabalu mololu amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, gili hilisesia, ninimo gili galiba ligia, dabalu moloba alolumo, balu weaselualeba asigibu. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">HD 16.19-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17.1-9</ref></char></note>Nini gili labea aso milibale ligia, Filibai sidi ami labi, nini naga disia, ilihe nine domala woba dafuluba, gili asigiba obegefebu. Aufia, nini gine dauno ami saabimo, inolo noolo amida ninidai gisa adeso. Auluso, nine gisa baaba nini gigililuale. Aubale. Godehe nini sagoba ofelesi, nini kiwigaafia ligia, ninihe Godene awalu sulu nafulu gilifea saaba melu. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Ninihe gili Yesufea asigi ule homaba solumo, gili seseaba soluale. Aufia, ninihe asigi muguba ofasia, gili gegesia masega soluale. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:10">Gal 1.10</ref></char></note>Aubale. Godehe nine asigi dedeba bafasia, Ene hame alefasia, Ene awalu sulu nafulu amone isoba samesi, ninifea dabalu melu. Aulugulu, idele inolohe nine dabalu molofe amo hamemesifia, nini sulu amo selesuale. Aubale. Gode E-su nine libo osolalo. Aulune, ninihe dabalu molofemo, Gode E-su hamemesi mololo.<verse eid="1TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Nini gilidai ligia sulu solumo, sulu ulenoda gilifea hahanoba masega gasiaguba ofelesia soluale. Aufia, nini gilidai damene alolumo, gine kegele dobu amone mesegesia aloluale. Aubale. Gili auba asigibu. Aufia, Gode Eda, amo sealeba saaba dafelagosia, E olofa labe. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Nini alefasia, gilifeada, idele inolo noolofeada, wi bule diyone hilisesia, dabalu mololuale. Aubale. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Seale koleba, nini <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> dabalu mololo inolo lolu. Aulugulu, hilibaisi daalu dabalu mololo wi amone alefasia, nini wi bule diyofia, gilifea nini sagoba homaleba sabaiyo. Auluso, nini gilidai ligiamo, auba auluale. Aubale. Enaehe faibefea bu melo amogulu, nini gili aleba ligia, hamedofa alolu. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ninihe gili bule hameselugulu, Godene awalu sulu nafulu gilifea saaba meyone henefiasu ado. Aufia, ninihe gili sagoba ofelesia, nine miliyolu weaseyo amoda, nini madenefia alolu. Maumo, gili nine damene koleba alebaibu.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:34">HD 20.34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, nini gili labea ligia, ninihe Godene awalu sulu nafulu gilifea selaba ligia, hogololu dabalu moloba alolumo, gili obegeba asigifebu. Fogo ami, naiyo kegelefealo amone, ninihe gilifea higinilu meyale hamelu. Aulune, ninihe nigilibada, yaidada, kiwigaaba dabalu moloba alolu. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Ninimo, gili sigidubulu idele inolo aleba ami alolumo, nini galagololu isolu ligia, seale molosia, heleba daabale moloba alolu. Godeda, gilida, auba asigiba ligia, olofa labe. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11-12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:31">HD 20.31</ref></char></note>Enaohe ene faibefea molologuba, ninihe gili ule ulebafea auba molosia, gine asigi degeba ofelesia, gine libo kiwigaaba ofelesia, sulu selaba alolu. Aufia, gili Gode Ene mana seale amone koleba kuliba daaba melesine, nini gilifea solu. Godehe gili Ene Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami <char style="w">elalelu</char> misiyo milesifia welu. Gili auba asigibu.<verse eid="1TH 2:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keliso idele inolo ili asigi ule ofasia, higinilu dife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 2:13">2Des 2.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hilia sunia, ninihe kegele eweneda Godefea henelu sulu selabasu ado. Gilihe nini walelu sulu disiamo, amo inolone sulu diloguba duluale. Aubale. Gilihe Godene seale sulububa hilisesia dulu. Aufia, sulu amohe, Kelisofea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> idele inolo gine libofea dabalu molofe.<verse eid="1TH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:5">HD 17.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, Godene <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo Yudia labe ili amo, Keliso Yesufea kulifia ligia, higinilu dife amogubasu, gilida aubasu higinilu dife. Ilihe <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolone sone alefasia naga duluguba, gilida gine damenedali alefasia naga dulu. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">HD 9.23</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13.45</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14.2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref></char></note>Yuda ili amohe <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesuda dufasia, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo nooloda yasofia, aufia, ninida asigaba dafalilu. Ilihe mana Gode hamefemo saidafalisia, aufia, ilihe idele inolo suniafea gisa adefe. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ilida obegeba dilosifia, ilihe nini Godene sulu mana yau mosomufea walemabiyosia, nine eno kaafe. Mana auba molofe amofea alefasia, ilihe ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolumo</char> dauna galabia wasigalabia fela abia elosiamo, gadilo diyo holobagafe.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Desalonaika ili saabia babiyo koleba hamelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Ilihe nini gilidai alolumo saabia no melesialefia, auba kaasi, ninihe fogo wedino alefasia hago ligia, gine olegi abuluale. Auluso, ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, nine asigimo gilidai alolu. Ausia, nini obegeba inigia, gili saabia babiyone kiwigaaba eno isaba alolu. Ninihe gili babaiyeba bule koleba hamelu. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Ninimo gili labea miyo hamelu. Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, na kolebamo, milibaiyesia, fogo saabia saabiaba weiyaabasu alolu. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenehe</char> nini kaalu.<verse eid="1TH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:15-16">Fil 2.15-16</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:1">4.1</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:4">2Des 1.4</ref></char>
    </note>Nine Saminilo Yesu obegeba saabimo, ninihe amene kegele molosi kiwigaafia henefia, Ene olegia kalugaeyobafebi? Ninihe nine dabalu nafulu molosiamo, amene kegele dibia waleyone holobagaeyobafebi? Seale, nine henelomo, gilifeasu diyo dobu. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Seale koleba, gilifea alefasia, Godehe hilia ami nine wi digiyobafe. Aufia, gilihe nine libo heneba homesi mololo.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Folohe Dimodimo Desalonaika idele inolo kiwigaaba homesi hilibailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:15">HD 17.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ninihe gili bule koleba keleba hiliseba ligia, gili halaguba labelaba dobaiyesia, fogo selale saabia no yasiyodoluale adefe. Auluso, Saelesedai ani gili labea miyodoluale adefe. Aulugulu, nini nenefasia, Dimodihe animo Adenese iwi waagi afelesia, e elebisu gili labea aasenaga, amo nafulu. Aulugulu, anihe e malalelu. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1-3">HD 16.1-3</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodi</char> amo nine nelewo. E Godedai ua dabalu mololo ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> awalu sulu nafulu walelo. Ehe gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> kiwigaaba ofelesia, sagoba homesisia, anihe e-mo gili labea hilibailu. <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:12">2Dim 3.12</ref></char></note>Aufia, higinilu gili dulu ogo alefasia, gili aleba uleno bubuliba ofolosisia, ehe gili kiwigaaba homesine hilibailu. Gine gilihe eweguba asigibu. Nini sigidubulu idele inolo higinilu auba diyo dobu. Eno no male. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ani aso gili labea ligiamo, gilifea eweguba selaba alolu. Ninifea higinilu nokene nokeneba holobagagaeyobafeba solu. Aulugulu, nini saaba ofa soluguba, hilia wolu aga holobagabuba, gili hilisebu. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Mau amo alefasia, na saabia no yasiyodoluale alolu. Na sagiliba hilisesia, Dedeba Bolo Inolohe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dedeba Bolo Inolo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, Sedene iminife. </char></note> gine asigi ule ufulumo dedeba besabi, nine hogololu dabalu gili aleba mololumo weaselosiba hiliselu. Aulune, gine asigi ule ufulu ogo halaguba labelaba eloba babiyone, nahe Dimodimo gili labea malalelu.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dimodihe sulu nafulu dia saabi, Folo e henelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:5">HD 18.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodi</char> e abia, gilidai alefasia, aga waagi e ani labea obegeba inigia goaso. Aufia ehe gine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumoda</char>, gine hameselomoda, anifea nafuluba awaba meso. E selesia, hilia sunia, gilihe ani hiliseba obegesia, gine libo heneba ado. Aufia e selesia, ani gili babaiyeba hilisefe amoguba, gilida aubasu ani babaiyeba koleba hameba adobiyo. Dimodi anifea auba awaba meso. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:4">2Des 1.4</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, ani higinilu usu loluso, gine asigi ule ufulu kiwigaafia labeba awaba solumo dubulu amohe, anine libo kiwigaaba ufulu. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Gili <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> kiwigaafia alebaibuba ani auba asigisu amohe, aga ani asigi nafulu disu.<verse eid="1TH 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Nini gili hilisefiasu ligia, nini Godene si saabiamo henefiasu lolu. Henelo nini auba dulu amone, Godefea heneba obegeba sabe saeyomo, lililualeba koleba hilisesu. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Nigilibada, yaidada, ninihe gine misi saabia bamesine, Godehe ninifea fogo memesine, Edai koleba sulu selaba ado. Ausimo, nini gilidai adesenaga, gine asigi ule ufulu amofealo aso abobofea ami, ninihe amo gegoaba ufiyobasu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Godedai sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 2:16-17">2Des 2.16-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nine hamefemo, nine Nao Godedai, nine Saminilo Yesudai, Aaluhe ninimo gili labea ugi lubia milesi eno felamesi hamefe. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Nini hamefemo, Saminilohe gilifea eweguba molomesi hamefe. Gine hameselomo bulesia, gilifea wasigafia koleba galeba dedalemesi hamefe. Ausi, gili elebi elebibahe hamesesia, idele inolo nooloda hameseyobafe. Ausi, ninihe gili hamesesuguba, gilida aubasu noolo anogoda hameseba miliyobafe. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Aufia, mana ewehe Gode alefasia, gine libo kiwigaaba ufiyobafe. Ausi, nine Saminilo Yesu inigia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Ene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> sunia E amaleba alebaibi fogo amimo, Ehe gilimo Edai muuba kalilu noekene alebaibi babiyobafe. Aufia, gili nine Nao Godene si saabiamo heleba daaluda male miliyobafe.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Ninihe susugu mana molomabiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, mana sunia ninihe gilifea walelu amo, ewe. Gode E hamefeguba kuliba daaba maiyone mana amo, ninihe gilifea walelu. Seale, mana amo, gili ama kuliba daabasu ado. Aga ninihe <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesune wi alefasia, gine libo koleba kiwigaaba ofelesia, gilifea eweguba susiba selesu. Gili koleba, Ene manamo aso mololabiasu daaba melale. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Saminilo Yesune wifea alefasia molomesi sulu sunia, ninihe gilifea saaba melumo, gili asigibu.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 5:23">1Des 5.23</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:16">1Fid 1.16</ref></char>
    </note>Gode Ene hamemo eweguba. Gili koleba, gine miliyolu ogo sunia Efea memale. Ehe gilimo noekene galagololu moloba ufiyo hamefe. Gili auba Edai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> melesi moloba ufulugulu, susugu mana nokene nokeneba dobumo sunia elaba damale. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:13">1Kld 6.13</ref></char></note>Gili elebi elebiba, gine domala ogo nafuluba yasisia, enaoba melale. Godedai muuba kalilu galagololu melale. Ausi, gine wimo, nafulu miliyobafe. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Gilimo, Godeda asigiluale inolo susugu mana moloyone libo degeba yaafia adoguba adosi. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Susugu mana mololofealomo, gine gelewo uleno gegesia muguba homabiyo. Inolo mana ewegulu molofemo, Saminilohe efea obegeba mana saeyobafe. Saminimo, ninihe gilifea haguguba auba ama solu. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:15-16">1Fid 1.15-16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:14">Hib 12.14</ref></char></note>Godehe nini mana nugumalu amogulu kuliba malesi weluale koleba. Aubale. Ehe nini welumo, nini Edai muuba kalilu melesi welu. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lug 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 1:22">2Kld 1.22</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, inolo sulu ewe saidafelefemo, inolone sulu saidafelefale. Aubale. E Godene sulu saidafelefe. Gode amo alefasia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> ninifea melu.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninihe mana nafulu moloyo amone kiwigaeyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yon 13.34</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Gode Ene Ehe, gilifea walesia, gine damenedalifea hameseba melesi walelubiyo. Aulune, gilifea gine geleba hamesemaleba saabia no saeyone, nafea dabalu male. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Aulune, gilimo, sigidubulu idele inolo fogoba asulu <char style="w">Masedonia</char> amo sunia hameselo. Aulugulu, ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, nini gilifea eweguba susiba selesu. Mana ewe saabia mololabia daabasu melale.<verse eid="1TH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:28">Efe 4.28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili esebalo asebaiyeba kiwigaafia ligia, gili koleba, ene eneba dabalu molomale. Gili gine sone ogo dabalu molomale. Ninihe gilifea samini ama solu amoguba moloba melale. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Ausi, gili kegele abobobale ligia, inolo noolo anogofea kegele haaliyone dabalu male miliyobafe. Ausi, yau idele inolo ilihe gine mana bisigia, gili inolo nafulu labeba saeyobafe. <figure style="fig" alt="Villagers going about their day" file="BA03020.tif" size="col" copy="used with permission of Louise Bass (SIL)" ref="4.11-12">Mosomu idele inolo dabalu ene eneba moloba labe.</figure><verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saminilo E obegeba inigia nini wakaliyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13-14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.13-14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:9">Lom 14.9</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:3-4">1Kld 15.3-4</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 15:12">12</ref></char>
    </note>Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, doma. Daneba yaalu idele inolo ili amofea kegele moloyobafemo, gili nafuluba asigimesi, nini auba hamefe. Inolo uleno olasi, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluale</char> idele inolo ili amo, yagunagasia, bule koleba yegililo. Auluso, asigi ule ufulu ninimo, Yesu olafasia haiba degeluba asigifia lolu. Aulugulu, nini ewefea nine <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> lolu. Godehe sigidubulu idele inolo danelu ilimo, Yesu alefasia obegeba difasia, lubia maiyobafe. Aulune, sigidubulu uleno olasi, gili yagunagasia bule yegiliyone dabalu male adefe.<verse eid="1TH 4:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:51-52">1Kld 15.51-52</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ninihe Saminilone sulu gilifea eweguba saaba mesu. Saminiloda obegeba saabe hilia amimo, idele inolo aso bebea kakainabu nini ewe, ninihe danelu ili amo suniafia, saminiba maiyobasuale. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Aubale. Eweguba moloyobafe. Godehe molomaba selesi, sulu dia ano olaibohe koleba wuaasi, Godene fuulo galasi, Saminilo E <char style="w">hebene</char> afasia suga miyobafe. Ausi, idele inolo Kelisofea kulifia ligia, daneba yaalu amo, ilidale degeyobafe. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Fogo amoyamo, nini idele inolo aso bebea kakainabu ewe, ninimo, idele inolo ili amo galiba, iwa saabia, Saminilo wakaliyone sigiba dibia felaeyobafe. Aufia, nini Saminilodai miliyolu ligia, alefalu miliyobasu. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Aulugulu, gili koleba, sulu amone selebasu ligia, gine geleba libo kiwigaaba homale.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Saminilo milesi nini koleba madenefia miliyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Aga, ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, kegele ewe holobagaeyobafemo, hiliadai, fogodai, amoyamo moloyobafeba, nahe gilifea seleba meyone dabalu malebu. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:42-43">Mad 24.42-43</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2Fid 3.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:3">MUU 3.3</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, gine gili ewe asigibu, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> hilia holobagaeyobafemo, fadilo inolohe nigiliba anoguba, hidigiba dafa asigibale labi miyobafe. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:39">Mad 24.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:34-35">Lug 21.34-35</ref></char></note>Idele inolo ilihe eweguba saeyobafe, “Agamo, hilia nafulu adefene, nini <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char>, sagilibale nafulu alebaisu.” Auba selaba labi, idohe faibe haseyone naga alebale hamagi maugalo amoguba, woba dafiyo hiliamo holobagaeyobafe. Ausi, ilimo kegele amo elaba daafia dedaleyobafale.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Auluso, ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, gilimo, nigili gagaiya alebaibualene, hilia wolu fadilo anoguba holobagafe ewemo, gili hidigiba babiyobafale. Aubale. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:12">Lom 13.12</ref></char></note>Gili sunia, yaidane faibili ligia, yanene faibili alebaibu. Nini nigilibadai, nigili gagaludaine idele inolo loluale. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Aulugulu, nini inolo noolo haneba gagalibuguba hanelosi. Auluso, nini si kolafia ligia, asigi sawalu melale. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Nini asigibu, hanelo ilimo, nigiliba hanelo. Aufia, kagoalo ilimo, nigiliba kagoalo. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Ais 59.17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe 6.14</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 6:17">17</ref></char></note>Auluso, nini yaidane idele inolo alebaibune, nine asigi sawalu melale. Nini koleba, yobolo inolohe biyo subulu hamesa haguba selo amoguba, Godefea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> manada, hameselo manada, amo semale. Aufia, nini gunia habuga saligaloguba, Godehe nini obegeba gasiba dimesine <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogoyone</char> mana amomo saligamale.<verse eid="1TH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Godehe nini iminisiamo, Ene kanolomo dimesi iminiluale. Aubale. Ehe nini iminilumo, nine Saminilo Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisohe</char> nini <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> dimesi iminilu. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:8-9">Lom 14.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:14">1Des 4.14</ref></char></note>Yesu E nini sagoba ufiyone olalu. Aulugulu, nini bebea esenagada, me nini olasenagada, nini Edai bebea miliyo. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Aulugulu, gili aga moloba labeguba, gili gine geleba kiwigaaba ofa saamale.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe keliso idele inolo mana nafulu molomesi sagoba ufiyobafe</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, aga nini gilifea eweguba selesu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TH 5:12" />
  <para style="li" vid="1TH 5:12">Gilimo, inolo gilida sagoba waalesia, hogoloba dabalu molofe ili amone sisa melale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1TH 5:12">Saminilohe ilimo gine guni melesi gadefabu. Ili alefasia, gine mana isosia, gilifea sulu saaba melo.<verse eid="1TH 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Gili koleba, dabalu ili molofe amone hilisesia, ili amo koleba hamesesia, ine wi digiba melale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1TH 5:13">Aufia, gili sunia koleba hilise ule melale.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 3:6">2Des 3.6</ref>, <ref loc="2TH 3:11">11</ref></char>
    </note>Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, ninihe gilifea eweguba kiwigaaba selesu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TH 5:14" />
  <para style="li" vid="1TH 5:14">Habalo kakainabumofea ili ine dabalu molomasia, haguguba saamale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1TH 5:14">Idele inolo noolo anogo kiwidale alebaibu amone sagoba homale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1TH 5:14">Aufia, noolo sagiliba yaafe amone isomesi, ine asigi dedegeba homale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1TH 5:14">Aufia, gili idele inolo suniafeamo onafia, esebalo melale.<verse eid="1TH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:17">Lom 12.17</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:9">1Fid 3.9</ref></char>
    </note>No anogo alefasia gilifea wolu molosenaga, gilihe mana wolu sabe moloba obegemabiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1TH 5:15">Auluso, hilia sunia gilihe gine geleba mana nafulu molosia, idele inolo suniafeada, mana nafulusu molomale.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 4:4">Fil 4.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hilia sunia, gili henebasu melale.<verse eid="1TH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Aufia, gili fogo sunia, Godedai sulu selabasu melale.<verse eid="1TH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:20">Efe 5.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Amene kegele gili labea holobagasenagada, gilihe Godefea henelu sulu selabasu melale. Gode hamefemo ewe, Keliso Yesufea kulifia alebaibu gili amohe Godefea henelu sulu samesi hamefe.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:30">Efe 4.30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenene</char> de waiyafemo usumabiyo.<verse eid="1TH 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Aufia, inolo noolohe Asubane alefasia sulu saaba ofa selesi, gilihe sulu ili selefe amo waaselaba bisigia saidamabiyo.<verse eid="1TH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 4:1">1Yon 4.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aubale. Auluso, gilihe sulu saaba ofa solu amo, seale Godefea mululaba nafuluba osolamale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1TH 5:21">Aufia, gilihe sulu nafulumo fedoba semale.<verse eid="1TH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Aufia, mana wolu suniafeada hago melale. <figure style="fig" alt="Praying" file="44_Ac_12_03_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="5.17">Godedai sulu selabasu melale.</figure><verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 3:3">2Des 3.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gode E <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealo</char> mau ligia, Ene E alefasia, gili Edai <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">muuba kalilu melesi moloba ufiyobafe</char>. Ausi, gine miliyolu aleba ogo sunia galagololu miliyobafe. Aulugulu, nine Saminilo Yesu Keliso saabimo, gine asubaneda, <char style="w" lemma="Asigine libo">asigine liboda</char>, domalada, sunia heleba daalu ulenoda male melesi, nini Godedai auba sulu selesu. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Aufia, Gode gilida welumo, E alefasia moloyoba saaba ufulu amo mololo. Aulugulu, gilifea kegele amo moloba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:3">Kol 4.3</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:1">2Des 3.1</ref></char>
    </note>Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, Godehe nini sagoba homesine, gili koleba, Edai sulu saamale. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Gili gine sigidubulu damene heneba wakalisiamo, sunia <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">muuba kaliba</char> mimisia wakalimale. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Nahe Saminilone wi saabia gilifea kiwigaaba eweguba selesu, gilihe sowi ewe Godene idele inolo suniafea alegaba memale.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> gilidai miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 5:28">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="5.28" /><verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>